WEBVTT

00:33.010 --> 00:36.340
Don't give up and do your best

00:36.340 --> 00:39.720
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

00:39.720 --> 00:42.770
I know perfectly

00:42.770 --> 00:46.440
How weak a person is on their own

00:46.650 --> 00:49.610
Things that are on the verge of being lost

00:49.610 --> 00:53.280
I hold them close to my chest

00:53.280 --> 00:56.240
Your gentle words

00:56.240 --> 01:00.200
Caress my cheeks

01:00.200 --> 01:03.250
The irritation that has been building up

01:03.250 --> 01:06.040
From wanting to reach the goal

01:06.040 --> 01:10.210
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:10.210 --> 01:13.800
The place that warms it up

01:13.800 --> 01:16.720
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:16.720 --> 01:20.220
We have to protect this

01:20.220 --> 01:21.680
We're unripe fighters!

01:21.680 --> 01:23.600
We won't lose now

01:23.600 --> 01:26.980
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:26.980 --> 01:30.400
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:30.400 --> 01:33.860
Then release it towards the sky!

01:33.860 --> 01:35.400
The courage that cannot be stopped

01:35.400 --> 01:37.240
jump and shoot

01:35.400 --> 01:37.240
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

01:37.240 --> 01:40.160
I will pass the ball to you

01:40.160 --> 01:44.450
The memories that are awoken by our calls

01:44.450 --> 01:48.000
Game

01:44.450 --> 01:48.000
Will move the game along

01:54.920 --> 01:57.720
Wow, there are so many.

01:57.220 --> 02:02.420
In Love With Your Bud

01:57.720 --> 02:00.140
Is this the same brand as your old shoes?

02:00.140 --> 02:01.640
Yes.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.260
Which ones should I get?

02:03.260 --> 02:06.640
Last time Subaru lost consciousness and never found out about the entire situation,
but somehow he was able to avoid getting into a pinch since the girls didn't find him.

02:03.850 --> 02:05.350
These might be good.

02:05.350 --> 02:06.640
Oh, but..

02:15.900 --> 02:16.900
Are you okay?

02:20.780 --> 02:23.080
It's the first time I've seen her fall.

02:20.780 --> 02:23.080
I can't choose.

02:26.580 --> 02:29.960
Thank you so much for bringing me here.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.830
You're welcome.

02:31.830 --> 02:33.710
It's good that you found a pair you like.

02:33.710 --> 02:34.840
Yes.

02:37.050 --> 02:38.260
Subaru-san?

02:38.260 --> 02:38.800
Um...

02:38.800 --> 02:40.550
Aren't these bags nice?

02:41.800 --> 02:43.550
Yes, they are.

02:43.550 --> 02:45.510
I think they look really cute.

02:45.510 --> 02:46.810
Excuse me.

02:45.510 --> 02:49.690
Um, what kind of pattern is this?

02:46.810 --> 02:49.690
I'm looking for a Nashiba High School swimsuit.

02:49.690 --> 02:51.440
Okay, please wait a moment.

02:51.900 --> 02:54.070
When do you guys start swimming at Nashiba?

02:54.070 --> 02:56.480
Right after tests finish.

02:56.480 --> 03:00.150
The president is quite good at swimming, right?

03:00.500 --> 03:03.030
That's not true.

03:03.990 --> 03:05.580
I'm sorry about earlier.

03:05.910 --> 03:07.160
I held your shoulder without thinking.

03:07.160 --> 03:08.370
That's okay.

03:08.370 --> 03:11.580
I was surprised, but it's not that I don't like it or anything...

03:12.580 --> 03:14.250
It's nothing.

03:16.460 --> 03:17.800
Isn't that a date?

03:18.510 --> 03:19.510
It's not.

03:19.510 --> 03:20.510
That's nice.

03:20.510 --> 03:22.220
I want to go, too.

03:22.220 --> 03:24.760
No, no, this is only for these two young people.

03:24.760 --> 03:26.390
It's your first date, right?

03:26.390 --> 03:28.100
It's not like that!

03:28.100 --> 03:29.680
We're just buying new shoes.

03:29.680 --> 03:32.100
Tomo, do your best.

03:32.100 --> 03:34.610
You'll need to do things like hold hands or have him hold your shoulders.

03:34.610 --> 03:36.610
Tomoka-chan is so grown-up.

03:36.610 --> 03:37.860
Good luck, Mo-kan.

03:37.860 --> 03:38.690
That's nice.

03:38.690 --> 03:40.650
I want to him to hold my shoulders, too.

03:40.990 --> 03:42.820
Geez!

03:42.820 --> 03:43.910
Tomoka?

03:45.160 --> 03:45.990
Tomoka!

03:46.910 --> 03:48.080
Yes!

03:48.080 --> 03:49.120
What is it?

03:49.120 --> 03:49.830
Here.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.710
A present for you.

03:52.420 --> 03:54.290
Will you accept it?

03:54.290 --> 03:57.380
It's a thank-you for training with me every morning.

03:57.380 --> 03:59.300
It's something like an anniversary.

03:59.300 --> 04:00.300
Our first.

04:01.510 --> 04:02.470
Our first anniversary?

04:02.470 --> 04:03.840
Ah, never mind.

04:03.840 --> 04:05.720
Anyway, it's just something cheap.

04:05.720 --> 04:08.140
It'd be great if you used these every day.

04:08.560 --> 04:10.270
Our first...

04:12.690 --> 04:14.400
Thank you very much.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.940
I'll treasure these.

04:15.940 --> 04:20.230
I'll use them whenever I feel like I need your power!

04:22.240 --> 04:25.410
Subaru has been acting weird recently, don't you think?

04:25.410 --> 04:26.200
Huh?

04:26.200 --> 04:27.320
What do you mean?

04:27.320 --> 04:28.990
He's been so sneaky lately.

04:28.990 --> 04:32.120
And even though there aren't any club activities, he disappears right after school.

04:32.120 --> 04:37.000
A while back, he also talked about teaching an amateur girl as if he was used to it.

04:37.000 --> 04:42.210
Oh. He seemed pretty awkward
when he talked to girls in middle school.

04:42.210 --> 04:44.470
He had a pretty good husband/wife relationship with you, President.

04:44.470 --> 04:47.050
Actually, it was more of a "you hit him" relationship.

04:47.050 --> 04:48.550
That's right, that's right.

04:48.550 --> 04:51.850
Not being able to see that every day was our only regret.

04:51.850 --> 04:53.520
You two...

04:53.520 --> 04:55.940
Aren't the two of you getting along well at Nashiba?

04:55.940 --> 04:57.940
We aren't really getting along or anything!

04:57.940 --> 05:00.980
And we haven't been talking much recently...

05:00.980 --> 05:02.190
Is that true?

05:02.190 --> 05:04.070
We're in different classes, too.

05:04.070 --> 05:07.740
He hasn't been seeing me apart from our gatherings.

05:07.740 --> 05:11.080
I wonder if he's actually studying for the tests.

05:12.500 --> 05:15.080
The next gathering is tomorrow, right?

05:15.080 --> 05:17.670
Huh? Yeah...

05:23.050 --> 05:23.920
Tests?

05:23.920 --> 05:25.050
That's right.

05:25.050 --> 05:27.380
Did you actually forget about them?

05:27.380 --> 05:29.390
Sounds like Hasegawa-sensei to me.

05:29.390 --> 05:32.600
I heard you've been disappearing straight after school lately.

05:33.680 --> 05:35.680
Do you have a girlfriend or something?

05:35.680 --> 05:37.690
There's no way that can be true!

05:37.690 --> 05:40.810
Well, Subaru has his Ogiyama, anyway.

05:40.810 --> 05:42.020
I guess you're right.

05:40.810 --> 05:42.860
That's true.

05:42.020 --> 05:42.860
Right?

05:43.150 --> 05:44.570
You people!

05:43.150 --> 05:44.570
You guys!

05:46.860 --> 05:48.650
By the way, Hasegawa-sensei,

05:48.650 --> 05:51.780
I still think you should study for your tests.

05:51.780 --> 05:54.950
The basketball club will be reinstated next year, right?

05:54.950 --> 05:59.170
If you fail your exams, that won't happen.

05:59.880 --> 06:01.250
Yeah.

06:01.250 --> 06:02.670
Ah, I've got it!

06:02.670 --> 06:06.470
President, why don't <i>you</i> tutor him for the tests?

06:06.470 --> 06:08.430
Nice idea, Zano!

06:08.430 --> 06:09.890
That sounds great.

06:09.890 --> 06:11.350
What's up with you guys?

06:11.350 --> 06:13.180
Also, if he needs to study, I can-

06:14.850 --> 06:16.020
How about it, President?

06:16.020 --> 06:17.270
You should do that.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.140
That's right.

06:19.140 --> 06:21.060
If he really insists on it...

06:22.190 --> 06:23.730
I'll accept the offer, then.

06:24.020 --> 06:26.650
If that's the case, we'll meet at your house next Sunday.

06:27.030 --> 06:30.820
This is in preparation for our tests, so you better not forget your promise.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.620
Sunday, right?

06:32.620 --> 06:33.700
It'll be fine.

06:33.700 --> 06:35.910
If I forget, I'll be killed.

06:41.080 --> 06:41.880
Hina!

06:41.880 --> 06:43.460
Oh~!

06:46.630 --> 06:47.420
Airi!

06:48.470 --> 06:49.340
Yes!

06:50.760 --> 06:51.640
I'm sorry!

06:56.640 --> 06:58.680
Thank you very much!

07:00.810 --> 07:01.810
Airi.

07:02.440 --> 07:03.270
Yes?

07:04.900 --> 07:06.690
Are you feeling sick?

07:06.690 --> 07:10.820
If there's something bothering you,
feel free to talk to me about it, okay?

07:10.820 --> 07:12.950
Hasegawa-san...

07:16.700 --> 07:20.210
Thank you for worrying about me.

07:20.210 --> 07:22.630
I'm fine.

07:22.630 --> 07:24.170
Thank you very much.

07:31.470 --> 07:32.590
Airi!

07:33.180 --> 07:33.970
Yes?

07:33.970 --> 07:37.140
I cherish you a lot, Airi!

07:42.480 --> 07:43.440
Subaru-san!

07:43.440 --> 07:44.480
Woah!

07:44.480 --> 07:45.440
You're amazing, Airi!

07:45.440 --> 07:46.770
He confessed to you again!

07:46.770 --> 07:47.690
What about Hina?

07:47.690 --> 07:49.360
Am I cherished, too?

07:49.360 --> 07:51.490
Now he's going for Airi!

07:52.360 --> 07:54.030
That's not what I meant!

07:54.030 --> 07:57.030
What I meant was, Airi is an irreplaceable existence to me!

08:01.620 --> 08:02.670
As I thought, Subaru-san is...

08:02.670 --> 08:03.830
Saki, what should we do?

08:03.830 --> 08:05.710
What should we do about this?

08:05.710 --> 08:06.590
Calm down.

08:06.590 --> 08:08.090
First, we should-

08:06.710 --> 08:09.920
I'm telling you, that's not what I meant!

08:10.880 --> 08:12.170
Pool lessons?

08:12.170 --> 08:14.260
Yes, they start the week after next.

08:14.260 --> 08:16.100
Airin can't swim.

08:16.100 --> 08:18.100
So that's why you seemed down.

08:18.720 --> 08:22.520
I'm sorry for making you worry about something like this.

08:22.520 --> 08:23.640
It's nothing.

08:23.640 --> 08:25.150
Thanks for telling me what was on your mind.

08:25.150 --> 08:26.060
That's it!

08:26.060 --> 08:28.650
Subarun can teach us how to swim!

08:28.650 --> 08:29.730
Oh~!

08:29.730 --> 08:31.440
Swimming with Onii-chan.

08:31.440 --> 08:34.110
I'd feel bad for Hasegawa-san!

08:34.110 --> 08:35.740
It's fine, it's fine!

08:35.740 --> 08:37.280
Right, Subarun?

08:37.280 --> 08:38.030
Yeah.

08:38.030 --> 08:39.280
Okay!

08:39.280 --> 08:41.330
We'll hold it at my pool. Is that okay?

08:41.330 --> 08:44.460
I'm sorry that you have to do this for someone like me.

08:45.620 --> 08:49.210
Let's say it's for educational purposes.

08:49.210 --> 08:52.760
Also, I'm happy to do this for you, Airi.

08:55.380 --> 08:58.800
If you say things like that, Tomo will get angry again.

08:58.800 --> 09:00.430
I won't!

09:00.430 --> 09:02.310
It's the same for Tomoka.

09:02.310 --> 09:05.520
I'll do whatever I can to help anyone here.

09:05.940 --> 09:07.730
Of course, for you too, Saki.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.900
But, there's no need to do that for someone like me.

09:10.900 --> 09:13.900
Hey, you're not allowed to say "for someone like me".

09:13.900 --> 09:15.610
I'm sorry.

09:15.610 --> 09:16.610
Oh~!

09:16.610 --> 09:18.490
Then, Hina won't say it, either.

09:18.490 --> 09:20.450
Yes, good girl.

09:20.450 --> 09:24.830
And for this plan, how does next Sunday sound?

09:25.160 --> 09:26.290
Got it.

09:26.290 --> 09:28.330
I'll prepare for it.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.090
I'm sorry, Aoi!

09:31.090 --> 09:33.510
Can I be excused from the next gathering?

09:33.510 --> 09:35.920
Something came up that I have to attend to, no matter what!

09:36.430 --> 09:37.130
I can't say it.

09:37.130 --> 09:40.100
I can't say that it's for research on
swimming for elementary schoolers.

09:42.430 --> 09:44.640
If it's something urgent, it can't be helped.

09:44.640 --> 09:47.190
Then, we'll call off the next gathering.

09:48.770 --> 09:52.520
I'll definitely try to make it up to you next week!

09:52.520 --> 09:53.860
Next week?

09:54.610 --> 09:55.940
Hey, Subaru.

09:55.940 --> 10:00.740
Just to be sure... you're still free on Sunday, right?

10:07.000 --> 10:09.500
So, what will you do?

10:09.500 --> 10:14.670
I'm really sorry, but can you somehow cancel that too?

10:14.670 --> 10:15.880
I see.

10:16.470 --> 10:17.720
Okay.

10:18.970 --> 10:21.600
As if I would say that!

10:25.390 --> 10:27.310
I don't blame her for getting angry.

10:27.310 --> 10:29.020
I did something pretty bad.

10:29.020 --> 10:29.940
Subarun!

10:30.650 --> 10:31.480
Come here for a bit.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.450
Maho?

10:42.700 --> 10:44.740
Ta-da!

10:44.740 --> 10:46.040
How does it look, Subarun?

10:46.040 --> 10:47.250
Does it look good on me?

10:49.160 --> 10:51.210
It looks... good.

10:51.210 --> 10:52.290
I knew it!

10:52.290 --> 10:55.630
Compared to this blue one, which one do you prefer?

10:55.630 --> 10:58.300
Ah, you can't tell if I don't put it on.

11:03.180 --> 11:04.350
You can't leave yet!

11:04.350 --> 11:04.970
Hina!

11:04.970 --> 11:06.350
Oh~!

11:06.350 --> 11:09.020
Koala Hug!

11:09.020 --> 11:11.730
Nya~

11:10.440 --> 11:13.360
Okay, now's my chance to take it off.

11:13.770 --> 11:15.520
Maho, what are you do-

11:18.940 --> 11:21.780
What are you two doing?!

11:22.780 --> 11:24.780
I'm really sorry.

11:25.120 --> 11:26.450
Gosh, Maho!

11:26.450 --> 11:30.540
And Hina, haven't I been telling you
not to listen to everything Maho tells you?

11:30.540 --> 11:31.870
What's wrong?

11:31.870 --> 11:34.710
I just asked him to choose a swimsuit.

11:34.710 --> 11:36.460
That was the worst way to do it!

11:36.460 --> 11:38.880
Well, Saki, let's leave it at that.

11:38.880 --> 11:40.220
We're running out of time.

11:40.220 --> 11:41.300
Time?

11:41.300 --> 11:43.390
Oh no, practice, practice!

11:43.390 --> 11:44.140
Oh~!

11:44.140 --> 11:45.890
Hina will go change, too.

11:45.890 --> 11:46.890
Hey!

11:46.890 --> 11:49.390
Apologise to Hasegawa-san properly!

11:49.390 --> 11:50.560
I'm sorry.

11:50.560 --> 11:54.520
Maho seems to be over-excited about Subaru-san coming to her house.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.810
I see.

11:55.810 --> 11:57.690
Then I've got to give it my all, too.

11:58.780 --> 12:00.280
Thank you very much.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.110
I'll try my best, too!

12:04.360 --> 12:06.490
Did I overdo it?

12:07.490 --> 12:08.740
Are you an idiot?

12:08.740 --> 12:14.080
I don't know what you're up to, but you can keep your twisted interests and throw your life away!

12:14.080 --> 12:14.880
Idiot!

12:16.000 --> 12:19.130
And if he really failed, it would be a bother.

12:19.420 --> 12:21.510
As a childhood friend...

12:20.380 --> 12:22.800
Strategic Notes for Mid-term Test

12:22.800 --> 12:23.720
Maths

12:23.590 --> 12:23.720
Beginning With
Parent and Child
The Swimming
Classroom for Children
The best ways
to get them to
like swimming

12:29.510 --> 12:30.970
I'm sorry, everyone.

12:30.970 --> 12:32.060
You all help me so much...

12:32.060 --> 12:33.600
What are you saying, Airin?

12:33.600 --> 12:37.730
Thanks to you, Subarun is coming to my house to play, and Airin will learn how to swim, too.

12:37.730 --> 12:38.900
It's perfect!

12:38.900 --> 12:39.610
That's true.

12:39.610 --> 12:42.190
If you're taught by Hasegawa-san, you'll definitely be fine!

12:42.190 --> 12:44.610
Hina will teach you the dog paddle!

12:44.610 --> 12:45.570
That's right.

12:45.570 --> 12:46.950
Let's all do our best!

12:46.950 --> 12:48.240
Everyone...

12:49.240 --> 12:50.330
Thank you.

12:57.000 --> 12:59.920
Tomoka, could this be...

13:00.340 --> 13:01.000
Yes.

13:01.000 --> 13:03.510
This whole place is the Misawa family residence.

13:03.510 --> 13:05.090
It's amazing, right?

13:10.100 --> 13:11.390
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

13:11.390 --> 13:14.230
I work for the Misawa family.

13:14.230 --> 13:16.270
My name is Kuina Hijiri.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.810
Please come in.

13:24.570 --> 13:27.030
Tomo, did Hasegawa-san ask you to wear that?

13:27.030 --> 13:28.620
No!

13:28.620 --> 13:30.330
I just didn't have anything else to wear.

13:30.330 --> 13:32.620
Airin, this is your swimsuit!

13:33.290 --> 13:34.040
This?!

13:34.040 --> 13:35.540
Oh~!

13:38.080 --> 13:39.580
I really don't think I can do this!

13:39.580 --> 13:40.840
I'm telling you, it's fine!

13:40.840 --> 13:42.300
It will definitely go well!

13:42.670 --> 13:44.550
Sorry for taking such a long time.

13:44.550 --> 13:46.720
Subarun, let's start straight away!

13:46.720 --> 13:47.800
All right.

13:47.800 --> 13:49.260
Then let's start off with warm-up exercises-

13:49.260 --> 13:50.100
We don't need to!

13:50.100 --> 13:52.430
We ran a lot while trying to catch Airin.

13:54.270 --> 13:55.310
Don't do it!

13:55.310 --> 13:56.890
It's okay, Airin!

13:56.890 --> 14:00.110
If you leave it to me, you'll learn how to swim in no time!

14:05.780 --> 14:06.650
Don't look away!

14:06.650 --> 14:09.700
There's no point if Subarun doesn't look.

14:09.700 --> 14:13.830
Airin is shy, so if Subarun looks at her, she'll try to hide herself.

14:13.830 --> 14:18.250
But here, there's no other place to hide apart from in the pool.

14:18.250 --> 14:20.960
Now, what will you do, Airin?

14:20.960 --> 14:23.420
Airi, I'm not looking.

14:23.420 --> 14:27.340
And that swimsuit looks good on you.

14:27.340 --> 14:28.630
No!

14:28.630 --> 14:31.260
Don't look at me, please!

14:32.140 --> 14:34.470
Airin finally went into the pool!

14:34.470 --> 14:36.310
Airi?

14:44.070 --> 14:46.070
I got it!

14:46.070 --> 14:47.400
No!

14:47.400 --> 14:50.700
I don't want to drown again!

14:54.160 --> 14:55.990
Okay, Maho, apologise.

14:55.990 --> 14:58.710
Airin, I'm really sorry.

14:58.710 --> 15:01.210
Never mind. It's okay.

15:02.380 --> 15:04.960
Then, let's start off with a game.

15:04.960 --> 15:07.710
We'll begin where everyone's feet can touch the bottom.

15:07.710 --> 15:08.840
Oh~!

15:12.800 --> 15:13.390
Airi.

15:13.390 --> 15:15.220
Yes?

15:15.220 --> 15:20.850
I'll be holding your hand like this for the whole day, so you'll never drown.

15:21.940 --> 15:24.310
Yes. I'll try my best!

15:24.860 --> 15:26.020
There!

15:26.020 --> 15:26.690
Yes!

15:26.690 --> 15:28.190
Hina, it's going towards you!

15:28.190 --> 15:29.030
Oh~!

15:29.030 --> 15:30.320
Leave it to me!

15:32.860 --> 15:33.780
Here.

15:33.780 --> 15:34.780
Sorry!

15:34.780 --> 15:36.700
It's in the middle of nowhere.

15:44.000 --> 15:45.630
Mo-kan, nice play!

15:45.630 --> 15:47.340
That was a very natural bump.

15:47.340 --> 15:51.680
No one would be able to tell that you were
jealous of Airi and wanted some attention, too!

15:51.680 --> 15:52.930
I didn't think like that!

15:52.930 --> 15:54.590
Oh~, that's unfair!

15:54.970 --> 15:57.260
Hina will hug, too!

15:58.850 --> 16:01.020
Oh, I'll do it, too!

16:02.600 --> 16:03.810
Saki, come here, too!

16:03.810 --> 16:04.980
Quickly!

16:04.980 --> 16:07.110
I'm not going to do something so childish...

16:09.480 --> 16:13.110
Then again, it's not good to mess up our teamwork.

16:13.110 --> 16:14.820
I'll only play along with you guys this one time.

16:21.450 --> 16:24.000
What kind of outfit have I been wearing all this time?

16:24.000 --> 16:25.380
You finally remembered.

16:25.380 --> 16:27.840
I think it looks good, Airi.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.880
It wouldn't fit me at all.

16:29.880 --> 16:32.300
Mo-kan, you wouldn't be able to fit in that in the first place.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.590
There isn't anything to hold it up.

16:33.590 --> 16:35.640
I'd be able to hold it up a little better than you, Maho!

16:35.640 --> 16:36.680
Stop it.

16:36.680 --> 16:37.970
Hearing things like that will just make us miserable.

16:37.970 --> 16:38.890
Why would it?

16:38.890 --> 16:41.220
Saki, at least you have something that allows you to wear that.

16:41.220 --> 16:42.770
That's-

16:43.640 --> 16:44.560
Oh~?

16:44.560 --> 16:46.520
Will Hina be able to hold it up?

16:49.070 --> 16:50.150
Hinata?!

16:50.150 --> 16:51.610
Hey, stop right there!

16:51.610 --> 16:53.950
Oh, Subaru looks like he's going to wake up.

16:55.950 --> 16:57.120
Here.

16:57.740 --> 16:59.200
Nice steal!

17:10.750 --> 17:13.050
Slowly, slowly.

17:16.380 --> 17:18.390
I'm sorry.

17:18.390 --> 17:19.600
One more time.

17:24.980 --> 17:26.060
I'm sorry.

17:26.060 --> 17:26.730
I-

17:26.730 --> 17:27.900
Don't worry.

17:27.900 --> 17:29.860
Let's stop here for the morning.

17:33.070 --> 17:35.240
Thank you for the meal!

17:35.240 --> 17:38.070
I'll prepare tea and dessert.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.410
Please wait just a moment.

17:39.410 --> 17:40.780
Okay!

17:55.300 --> 17:56.550
Airi.

17:57.720 --> 17:59.640
Hasegawa-san.

18:00.350 --> 18:01.550
I see.

18:01.550 --> 18:02.430
In a pond.

18:02.430 --> 18:03.520
Yes.

18:03.520 --> 18:06.390
A long time ago, I fell off a boat, and since then...

18:06.390 --> 18:11.650
As long as my feet could touch the bottom and my head was above the water, I would be fine.

18:11.650 --> 18:14.610
But I'm really pathetic.

18:14.610 --> 18:17.990
Even though Hasegawa-san went through the trouble of teaching me how to swim, I can't...

18:18.740 --> 18:20.570
I'm just a nuisance to everyone.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.500
There's no need to rush yourself.

18:28.670 --> 18:31.500
Everyone, including me, will be by your side.

18:31.500 --> 18:33.880
That's why you don't need to rush yourself.

18:34.340 --> 18:37.420
But I'm slow... and a coward!

18:37.420 --> 18:39.800
I didn't explain everything before, either!

18:39.800 --> 18:44.470
Be it swimming or basketball, I'm always troubling everyone.

18:45.430 --> 18:47.020
Did anyone say that?

18:47.600 --> 18:50.400
No one said anything like that, right?

18:50.400 --> 18:53.020
In fact, weren't we trying to encourage you?

18:53.020 --> 18:57.900
And if you think that way, everyone would seem really pitiful.

18:58.700 --> 19:02.320
Even if you do it slowly, we want you to make progress.

19:02.320 --> 19:04.870
I guarantee you that, as a coach.

19:04.870 --> 19:07.500
So Airi, just move at your own pace.

19:08.000 --> 19:10.080
Improve yourself together with everyone else.

19:11.620 --> 19:13.670
Hasegawa... san.

19:14.540 --> 19:15.800
Let's go back.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.210
Yes.

19:17.210 --> 19:18.510
Um...

19:18.510 --> 19:20.340
I'll try my best.

19:20.340 --> 19:21.430
So...

19:21.430 --> 19:23.390
Please take care of me from now on, too!

19:23.930 --> 19:25.970
Yeah, let's work hard.

19:35.730 --> 19:36.570
Everyone!

19:36.570 --> 19:39.570
First, hold hands with both people next to you.

19:42.610 --> 19:43.620
Airi.

19:43.620 --> 19:46.580
Now, everyone's by your side.

19:46.580 --> 19:49.700
It's not like the time when you fell into the pond, where you were all alone.

19:49.700 --> 19:54.960
So, try dipping your head into the pool for just ten seconds.

19:54.960 --> 19:55.790
Okay.

19:55.790 --> 19:57.500
I'll try.

20:08.060 --> 20:09.180
One...

20:09.180 --> 20:10.230
...two...

20:10.230 --> 20:11.310
...three...

20:11.310 --> 20:12.520
...four...

20:12.520 --> 20:13.690
...five...

20:13.690 --> 20:14.690
...six...

20:14.690 --> 20:15.900
...seven...

20:15.900 --> 20:16.690
...eight...

20:17.690 --> 20:18.980
...nine...

20:24.410 --> 20:25.410
Airi, good job!

20:25.410 --> 20:27.530
You did great! You did great, Airi!

20:27.530 --> 20:29.290
Airi, good job, good job.

20:29.290 --> 20:31.450
I always knew Airin could do it!

20:31.450 --> 20:33.870
It's only a matter of time before you'll be able to swim!

20:36.170 --> 20:38.290
Airi, as expected of you!

20:41.420 --> 20:42.970
Strategic Notes for Mid-term Test

20:43.630 --> 20:45.090
All right.

21:19.090 --> 21:21.500
[Keishin Private Academy]

21:28.470 --> 21:30.680
You're pretty comfortable in the water now, right?

21:30.680 --> 21:34.140
Yup, but I'm still not so good with my legs.

21:34.140 --> 21:35.230
It's fine!

21:35.230 --> 21:38.730
Subarun is going to teach you again next week, so it'll be fine!

21:38.730 --> 21:40.900
Okay, let's start!

21:40.900 --> 21:41.900
Yes!

21:45.740 --> 21:46.700
What...

21:46.700 --> 21:47.910
...are you doing?

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.830 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.500 --> 23:26.230
Good...

23:26.230 --> 23:27.280
Good afternoon!

23:27.280 --> 23:28.850
I'm Kashii Airi!

23:28.850 --> 23:31.890
What does "Prismatic Bud" mean?

23:31.890 --> 23:34.490
No one tells me...

23:34.490 --> 23:35.960
Ah, um...

23:35.960 --> 23:36.490
Next...

23:36.490 --> 23:38.790
Please watch again next week!

23:37.060 --> 23:40.020
Next Time:

23:37.060 --> 23:40.020
Stairway to Reincarnation
